      "kind": "stocktake_undo",
      "classification": "deliberate_difference",
      "reason": "Undoing a settlement here is the cancellation of the stocktake: it reverses the journal and the stock movements and puts the shelves back at the same average, and it keeps the stocktake with its lines, the journal marked as reversed and the journal that reverses it. The owner decided (E15, confirmed for the stock documents by E111) that a document with a journal is cancelled by a reversal and never deleted, so the books keep the original and its reversal. The reference system deletes the two permits and their two journals and puts the sheet back to a draft; here the stocktake ends cancelled.",
